        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Mental status examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Cooperative with maintained eye contact, somewhat tense and demanding at times. Speech normal in volume and rate, slightly pressured when discussing work and medication. Mood described as 'really low, overwhelmed'; affect congruent, tearful, and reactive. Thought form logical and goal directed. Thought content preoccupied with her father's death and guilt. Cognition grossly intact and oriented to person, place, and time."
      }
